// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 06-declarations/destructuring_binding_capability_neg.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A module-scope `let`/`mut` whose pattern is not a bare identifier carries a
// non-empty pattern path and a non-identifier leaf. The lowering has no
// producer for a destructuring binding yet, so the declaration drains as a
// source diagnostic instead of a checker invariant.
// CHECK: Error [ZOM4135]: destructuring module-scope bindings are not supported yet
